  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1001.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 485-A:29-44 relative to subdivisions and individual sewage disposal systems, in order to protect water supplies, prevent pollution in the surface and groundwaters of the state, and prevent nuisances and potential health hazards.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1000.html"
